.TH AVR\-TOKEN\-CREATE 1 "" "avr 0.4.1" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-token-create \- Create a scoped token and print its credential.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr token create
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a scoped token and print its credential.
.PP
The credential is shown once and cannot be retrieved later. A token needs at least one of --repo, --vm or --allow-vm-create. Repository grants are read-only and VM grants are admin; an optional level suffix (--repo acme/api:read, --vm cvm-abc123:admin) must name that level.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr token create --name ci-read --repo acme/api --repo acme/web
    avr token create --name agent --vm cvm-abc123 --ttl 30m
    avr token create --name sandbox --allow-vm-create --vm-create-limit 3
    avr token create --name ci-read --repo acme/api --json token --jq .token
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    allow_vm_create, created_at, expires_at, grants, id, last_used_at,
    name, organization_id, revoked_at, revoked_reason, token, user_id,
    vm_create_count, vm_create_limit
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fITEXT\fR
Token name (1-100 characters). (required)
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Grant read access to a repository (org/repo or rep-xxx). Repeatable. (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-vm\fR \fITEXT\fR
Grant admin access to a VM, by VM ID. Repeatable. (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-vm\-create\fR
Let the token create VMs.
.TP
\fB\-\-vm\-create\-limit\fR \fIINTEGER RANGE\fR
Max VMs the token may create; needs --allow-vm-create. The server default is 1.
.TP
\fB\-\-ttl\fR \fITEXT\fR
Lifetime: e.g. 30m, 8h, 7d, or a number of seconds. 60 seconds to 7 days; the server default is 8 hours.
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-token (1),
.BR avr-token-list (1),
.BR avr-token-revoke (1),
.BR avr-token-view (1)
